  body: `Prior Lessons — 1-Sentence Recap

Lesson 079: GPUs preserve flexibility, while custom silicon earns efficiency only when stable workloads keep enough deployed chips useful.

Lesson 080: Hyperscalers design chips when workload knowledge, software control and fleet scale outweigh fixed engineering cost and supplier dependence.

Lesson 081: Alternative accelerators reduce particular data-movement costs by accepting new manufacturing, compiler or device constraints.

